{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260423124353","title":"LLM penting sebagai pelurus intuisi engineering","desc":"Pengantar LLM harus memberi mental model yang cukup untuk membedakan probabilistic language generation dari deterministic code.","updated":1779935953064,"created":1776923070342,"tags":["zettel","ai","llm","mental-model"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260423124353","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"f6c6d53a2098df973d9c879b476ef89d","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260423124353","id":"zettel.20260423124353","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260423124353","id":"zettel.20260423124353","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260423124353","id":"zettel.20260423124353","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.llm","alias":"llm","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.llm"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260423124353","id":"zettel.20260423124353","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.mental-model","alias":"mental-model","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.mental-model"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260423124353","id":"zettel.20260423124353","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":3,"offset":435},"end":{"line":12,"column":48,"offset":480},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260423124353","id":"zettel.20260423124353","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.moc.ai-native","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":3,"offset":570},"end":{"line":13,"column":27,"offset":594},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.moc.ai-native"}}],"anchors":{"relevansi":{"type":"header","text":"Relevansi","value":"relevansi","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"llm-penting-sebagai-pelurus-intuisi-engineering\">LLM penting sebagai pelurus intuisi engineering<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#llm-penting-sebagai-pelurus-intuisi-engineering\"></a></h1>\n<p>Pengantar LLM tidak sedang membuat pembaca jadi peneliti. Ia sedang membuat pembaca jadi engineer AI yang punya intuisi: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>LLM bekerja token demi token dalam mode probabilistic,</li>\n<li>output terlihat natural tapi bisa saja salah,</li>\n<li>model punya batasan pengetahuan dan bias,</li>\n<li>prompt/context engineering adalah intervensi awal yang paling masuk akal,</li>\n<li>agentic AI muncul setelah kapasitas model dan konteksnya dipahami.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"relevansi\">Relevansi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#relevansi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a> — overview struktur dan level buku sebagai peta praktis AI engineering untuk developer</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.ai-native\">MOC AI-native engineering</a> — MOC AI-native engineering</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">llm (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">mental-model (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version"